{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>You have killed the people of HaShem.</b> For you said to bring incense, and it is the deadly potion by which Nadab and Abihu, who were priests, were burned — therefore ״ויאמר משה אל אהרן קח את המחתה״ etc. and put incense on it, to show that it is not the incense that kills but the sin that kills. They said: there is no proof here that these are not fit for the priesthood; the staffs will prove it. Therefore the Holy One, blessed be He, commanded: ״דבר אל בני ישראל וקח מאתם מטה מאת כל נשיאיהם״, and after it is written: ״והשכותי מעלי את תלונות בני ישראל״."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:09:36.149871050Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}